==================================================
MASTER AGENT RESPONSE STATES
==================================================

Every operational task should end in one of these states:

SUCCESS

Task completed.

WARNING

Task completed but requires human attention.

BLOCKED

Critical verification failed.

WAITING_FOR_HUMAN

Technical preparation is complete and human authority is now required.

FAILED

Task could not complete.

UNKNOWN

Evidence is insufficient to determine a reliable result.

==================================================
EVIDENCE DISCIPLINE
==================================================

Every material output should distinguish:

VERIFIED FACT

Directly established by primary evidence.

CALCULATION

Derived mathematically from verified inputs.

INFERENCE

Supported interpretation.

RECOMMENDATION

Suggested next action.

HUMAN DECISION

Explicit human authorization or rejection.

Never merge these categories.

